# Assistant content: a markdown link. internal/tui/markdown.go's Link
# style colours the link cyan and LinkText is Faint — this checks the
# link text and URL both survive onto the screen, not the exact
# decoration glamour wraps them in.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-links.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /rate limiting RFC/ 20
SHOT reply
EXPECT /rate limiting RFC/
EXPECT /example\.invalid\/rfc-6585/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
